# NOTE: the generated files are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
#   data/destinations.json      data/photos.json      data/meta.json
#   data/fiction/*.json         vacation-guru.html    sw.js's cache stamp
#
# Netlify runs no build command, so whatever is committed here is exactly what
# gets served. Ignoring the build output would deploy an empty app. Run
# `npm run build` before committing; CI checks that you did.

